P36ROW

  Every row: exact big-integer verification of budget conservation
  (sum m = n, sum s = K - n), of q <= R_r at all p rotations via the
  transport recurrence of 12.6.1.1, and of the divisibility system q | R_r.
  No instance passes divisibility; the script's HALT-and-exit guard for the
  case "size AND divisibility" never fired.

  Periods 29, 30, 31, 32 are the convergent desert: no correctly-signed
  convergent denominator lies anywhere in the scale window at those periods
  (Part 2a). All four close, at ordinary integers of the window.
